  <section id="survival" class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="section-container"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 text-center">Practical Survival Guide</h2><p class="mt-3 text-stone-500 text-center max-w-lg mx-auto">What nobody tells you about traveling in Gansu as a foreigner.</p>
      <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-mogao-50/40 transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-mogao-200"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center text-mogao-600 mb-4"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Phone &amp; Internet</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">Buy a China Mobile SIM at Dunhuang Airport. For eSIM, install Airalo or Nomad before departure. Install VPN before arriving. Download offline maps in Maps.me. Google Maps has location offset in China.</p></div>
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-mogao-50/40 transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-mogao-200"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center text-mogao-600 mb-4"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Money &amp; Payment</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">Install Alipay and link your Visa/Mastercard before traveling. Bank of China ATMs accept foreign cards. Carry cash for night markets (CNY 200-500). No tipping in China. WeChat Pay is near-universal.</p></div>
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-mogao-50/40 transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-mogao-200"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center text-mogao-600 mb-4"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"/><path d="M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8z"/><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="10" y1="1" x2="10" y2="4"/><line x1="14" y1="1" x2="14" y2="4"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Food Survival</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">Gansu has abundant halal restaurants. Must-try: donkey-meat noodles, lamb soup, apricot drink. Stick to bottled water. Shazhou Night Market opens 6pm to midnight. <a href="/food" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">Full food guide</a>.</p></div>
        <a href="/packing-list" class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-mogao-50/40 transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-mogao-200 no-underline block"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center text-mogao-600 mb-4"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.38 3.46L16 2a4 4 0 0 1-8 0L3.62 3.46a2 2 0 0 0-1.34 2.23l.58 3.47a1 1 0 0 0 .99.84H6v10c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h8a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V10h2.15a1 1 0 0 0 .99-.84l.58-3.47a2 2 0 0 0-1.34-2.23z"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">What to Pack <span class="text-xs text-mogao-500">→</span></h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">Season-by-season packing list for the Gobi Desert. Summer survival gear, winter cold-weather essentials, and the 10 items every traveler needs.</p></a>
        <a href="/survival-phrases" class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-mogao-50/40 transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-mogao-200 no-underline block"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center text-mogao-600 mb-4"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Chinese Phrases <span class="text-xs text-mogao-500">→</span></h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">30 essential Mandarin phrases with pinyin. Show to taxi drivers, hotel staff, and restaurant servers. Works offline.</p></a>
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-mogao-50/40 transition-colors border border-transparent hover:border-mogao-200"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-mogao-100 flex items-center justify-center text-mogao-600 mb-4"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/><path d="M12 21.7C17.3 17 20 13 20 10a8 8 0 1 0-16 0c0 3 2.7 7 8 11.7z"/></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">Getting Around Locally</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">Use Didi via Alipay for local taxis. Dunhuang city center is walkable. Hire a private driver for day trips (CNY 600-800/day). Carry your hotel's business card with the Chinese address. Always bring your passport.</p></div>
