    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <div class="text-center mb-12"><SectionHeader headingLevel="h2" eyebrow="FAQ" title="Questions Every Traveler Asks" subtitle="Straight answers from people who have been there -- not from a tourism brochure." center /></div>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl divide-y divide-stone-200">
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">How many days do I need?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">Minimum 4 days: 2-3 in Dunhuang, 1-2 in Jiuquan. With 7 days add Zhangye Rainbow Mountains. High-speed train: 2.5 hours. See our <a href="/itinerary" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">itinerary plans</a>.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">Can I visit Mogao Caves without a guide?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">No. All visitors must join a guided group tour. A-ticket holders see 8 caves over ~75 minutes. Photography strictly forbidden inside. Book 1-4 weeks ahead in peak season. <a href="/mogao-caves" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">Full Mogao guide</a>.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">Can I use Google Maps in China?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">Google Maps has location offset and is unreliable. Use Apple Maps (works on iPhones), Baidu Maps, or download Maps.me offline. Install VPN before arriving.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">Is Gansu safe for solo travelers?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">Yes, very safe. Violent crime is extremely rare. Main risks: extreme desert heat in summer (35-40C+), language barrier outside major hotels, and wandering off marked paths in Yadan Geopark.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">Which is better: Dunhuang or Jiuquan?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">Dunhuang if you can only visit one. Jiuquan for history buffs and space enthusiasts. With 5+ days, visit both. <a href="/dunhuang-vs-jiuquan" class="text-mogao-600 hover:text-mogao-700 underline">Full comparison</a>.</p></details>
        <details class="group py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-medium text-stone-800 hover:text-mogao-700 transition-colors list-none">How much should I budget per day?<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0 text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed pr-8">Budget: CNY 400-600 (hostel, street food, B-tickets). Mid-range: CNY 600-1000 (3-star hotel, A-tickets, private driver). Comfort: CNY 1000-2000 (4-5 star hotel, guided tours).</p></details>
